+/// GitLab-issues ticket source for [TeammateJob] — Java `GitLabTrackerClient`
+/// / `GitLabTicket` parity (epam/dm.ai#876).
+///
+/// Supports:
+/// - Single-issue or key-list queries (`namespace/project#42`, `gl-42`,
